{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54847","headline":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兵（京本作「军」）行次，蛇贯路边傍。\n备御伏（京本作「贼」）兵前道阻，且须仔细更思量，终不使开（京本作「利封」）疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}